/-!
INSACERMO — SAME laboratory, two *different* real-data analysis summaries.
Bari 2026.a preliminary NORMAL ORDERING reported 1D phase contours:
   2 sigma: 165.6°..297.0° (in tenths of degrees 1656..2970)
   3 sigma: 142.2°..351.0° (in tenths of degrees 1422..3510)
NuFIT v6.1 TByes NO: pinned 73-row numeric # DCP grid imported from
NuFIT61GridCertification (generated by exact-source SHA-pinned script).
